         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Adoptive cellular immunotherapy as a new paradigm to treat cancers is exemplified by the FDA approval of six chimeric antigen receptor-T cell therapies targeting hematological malignancies in recent years.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
